```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Players
    participant UI as Web Interface
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant ABM as Agent Model
    participant SD as System Dynamics
    participant HA as Hybrid Automaton
    participant LLM as Narrative Engine

    Note over P,LLM: Round N begins

    UI->>P: Display briefing (AQI, health, budget, events)
    P->>P: Deliberate (8 minutes)

    P->>UI: Submit actions (subsidy, ban, restriction)
    UI->>C: POST /api/turn (actions, weather)

    C->>ABM: compute_compliance(actions)
    Note over ABM: Farmers decide: burn or not?<br/>Industries: comply or evade?
    ABM-->>C: {burning_fires: 2500, industry_compliance: 0.6}

    C->>SD: update_emissions(burning, compliance, weather)
    Note over SD: Emissions → Dispersion → Accumulation<br/>PM2.5 stock changes
    SD-->>C: {PM2.5_delta: +150 μg/m³, new_AQI: 320}

    C->>HA: update_regime(AQI=320)
    Note over HA: Guard: AQI > 300 → HAZARDOUS<br/>Trigger GRAP Stage 3
    HA-->>C: {regime: HAZARDOUS, events: [GRAP_3, SCHOOL_CLOSURE]}

    C->>LLM: generate_narrative(AQI, burning, compliance, events)
    Note over LLM: "Delhi wakes to apocalyptic orange skies.<br/>3,500 farm fires detected..."
    LLM-->>C: {story_beats: [...], headlines: [...], quotes: [...]}

    C-->>UI: TurnResult {AQI, regime, health, events, narrative}
    UI->>P: Show consequences + narrative

    alt AQI > 400 (SEVERE)
        UI->>P: EMERGENCY! Crisis round triggered
        Note over P: Forced emergency actions
    else Round < 5
        Note over P,LLM: Proceed to Round N+1
    else Round == 5
        UI->>P: Game Over - Calculate scores
    end
```
